-friction gears and snap-fits are proposed applications.","source":"S-POM","at":"Application","domain":"Application","type":"Manufacturer statement","category":"application"}]},{"topic":"Good for","items":[{"id":"Q04381","text":"POM filament is therefore one of the preferred construction materials, e.g. B. for snap connections and gears.","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04382","text":"optimal for snap connections","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Benefits","items":[{"id":"Q04383","text":"It is one of the typical technical thermoplastics with good mechanical properties and high dimensional stability as well as excellent sliding and wear behavior.","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04384","text":"Due to its high crystallinity, POM filament has good resistance to numerous chemicals.","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04385","text":"They are resistant to diluted acids (pH > 4) as well as diluted alkalis, aliphatic, aromatic and halogenated hydrocarbons, oils and alcohols.","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04386","text":"Excellent sliding and abrasion behavior","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04387","text":"High resilience","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04388","text":"relatively high temperature resistance","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04389","text":"High toughness down to -40°C","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Pitfalls and limitations","items":[{"id":"Q04390","text":"They are not resistant to concentrated acids and hydrofluoric acid as well as oxidizing agents.","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04391","text":"The weather resistance is not good.","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04392","text":"narrow temperature range for processing","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Warping and shrinkage","items":[{"id":"Q04393","text":"Shrinkage (ISO 294-4) 0.95 %","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04394","text":"relatively high shrinkage","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Moisture sensitivity","items":[{"id":"Q04395","text":"POM has low moisture absorption and high gas density.","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Odour and emissions","items":[{"id":"Q04396","text":"If the processing temperature is too high, formaldehyde is released","source":"R-FABRU-PUREFIL-3519-Material-data-sheet-POM-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]}]}],"la